{
  "sn17.10:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 17.10 ",
  "sn17.10:0.2": "1. Paṭhamavagga ",
  "sn17.10:0.3": "Sagāthakasutta ",
  "sn17.10:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn17.10:1.2": "“Dāruṇo, bhikkhave, lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… adhigamāya. ",
  "sn17.10:1.3": "Idhāhaṁ, bhikkhave, ekaccaṁ puggalaṁ passāmi sakkārena abhibhūtaṁ pariyādiṇṇacittaṁ, kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā apāyaṁ duggatiṁ vinipātaṁ nirayaṁ upapannaṁ. ",
  "sn17.10:1.4": "Idha panāhaṁ, bhikkhave, ekaccaṁ puggalaṁ passāmi asakkārena abhibhūtaṁ pariyādiṇṇacittaṁ, kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā apāyaṁ duggatiṁ vinipātaṁ nirayaṁ upapannaṁ. ",
  "sn17.10:1.5": "Idha panāhaṁ, bhikkhave, ekaccaṁ puggalaṁ passāmi sakkārena ca asakkārena ca tadubhayena abhibhūtaṁ pariyādiṇṇacittaṁ, kāyassa bhedā paraṁ maraṇā apāyaṁ duggatiṁ vinipātaṁ nirayaṁ upapannaṁ. ",
  "sn17.10:1.6": "Evaṁ dāruṇo kho, bhikkhave, lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.10:1.7": "evañhi vo, bhikkhave, sikkhitabban”ti. ",
  "sn17.10:2.1": "Idamavoca bhagavā. ",
  "sn17.10:2.2": "Idaṁ vatvāna sugato athāparaṁ etadavoca satthā: ",
  "sn17.10:3.1": "“Yassa sakkariyamānassa, ",
  "sn17.10:3.2": "asakkārena cūbhayaṁ; ",
  "sn17.10:3.3": "Samādhi na vikampati, ",
  "sn17.10:3.4": "appamāṇavihārino. ",
  "sn17.10:4.1": "Taṁ jhāyinaṁ sātatikaṁ, ",
  "sn17.10:4.2": "sukhumaṁ diṭṭhivipassakaṁ; ",
  "sn17.10:4.3": "Upādānakkhay�